    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The months of August and September 2025 marked a period of intense activity and significant achievement for the Aga Khan University's Arusha Climate and Environmental Research Centre (AKU-ACER). The Centre solidified its reputation as a leading hub for environmental conservation, sustainable agriculture, and climate resilience across Africa, driven by reinforced institutional partnerships, groundbreaking academic collaborations, and robust community engagement.",
